2,"mm_score":-0.006566423922777176,"rank_movement":84,"has_visual_feature":true,"name":"Rouses Market","address":"701 Baronne St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70113","stars":4.0,"review_count":136,"categories":["Beer","Wine & Spirits","Food","Bakeries","Grocery"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":775,"mm_rank":691,"target_category_support_fraction":0.6,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":3,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Beer","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Wine & Spirits","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Bakeries","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Grocery","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Beer, Food, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","review_id":"wHH6JW2X-JD1imH0gX7Nzg","date":"2016-09-07T05:24:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9356338977813721,"text_excerpt":"New Orleans is one of the great food destinations in the world! I love grocery stores, I grocery shop several times a week at stores of all qualities and sizes. Even though I am a visitor of this fine city I have even been to the little Rouses market on Royal St in The French Quarter. This weekend I went to The Big Store on Barrone This particular store could even rival Bristol Farms or The best AJ's, and Whole Foods, its one of the best grocery stores I have ever been too. The biggest problem I could find was the layout, like most stores on a first visit I couldn't find things I wanted, and It really does have a super odd layout with sections here and there, in a very random logic. What ..."},{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","review_id":"kN44yTbPOfut0FbTJED2bw","date":"2016-04-26T13:35:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9301320314407349,"text_excerpt":"This is a great grocery store located between the CBD and the Warehouse District. This Rouses is a favorite for many locals. It's clean, well stocked and the staff is generally helpful and pleasant. I've only had one negative experience here and it was waiting for the bakery worker to even acknowledge me. After waiting about ten minutes for her to finish her cell phone conversation, she finally helped me with a cake. The checkout lines have never been too long, which is always a plus! You can get in and out with your one item in under 5 minutes... But we all know we are leaving with at least a basket full of groceries. I have come here for a grab and go lunch on a busy workday. I have eve..."},{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","review_id":"opGOKJl84kuH-euhxT_bnA","date":"2019-03-22T13:14:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9286118149757385,"text_excerpt":"This is a great grocery store. It has all your everyday items and then it has a great take away food section. They were filming around town while we were here in New Orleans and the film crew was here getting their evening meal, that says a lot. I bought some gumbo and it was very good. It would be nice if they had some seating. They had a sandwich bar and an omelette bar as well. The bakery had some very good looking items. So if your here on a visit and just want to take a break from eating out, this could be a choice. Unfortunately I was there for cold remedies."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","photo_id":"0TOfVLc9qVdkzMHpxHDsjA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0TOfVLc9qVdkzMHpxHDsjA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.925049901008606},{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","photo_id":"CJ8AzOslU4q0fpMm-CXoVw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CJ8AzOslU4q0fpMm-CXoVw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8772298097610474},{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","photo_id":"7mACYPx79z9ckMT9fWqKLQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7mACYPx79z9ckMT9fWqKLQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8747498989105225},{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","photo_id":"IymP_hkCFeDFRjBVrNqytQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/IymP_hkCFeDFRjBVrNqytQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8377920985221863},{"business_id":"nYzCXMzSk8pjMnYVI6z3RA","photo_id":"yvHsPESPXjIBFvO3uKG1_Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yvHsPESPXjIBFvO3uKG1_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8018012046813965}]},"notebook_case":null}
